'''MEIKO & Cat''' are a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule/Gacha]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 9.8 Update|version 9.8]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 561
|rarity = SR
|name1 = MEIKO & Cat
|name2 = MEIKO & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''MEIKO & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
For general use, this unit is less effective than [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] and [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nymph Cat]], so her use is recommended only if there are Red enemies. Against Reds, MEIKO can provide decent help against enemies such as [[Capy]] in the many stages that feature them. She can also take care of supporting Red enemies such as the [[Christmas D.]]s in [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 21|Floor 21]]. It is best against a large group of red enemies, especially if they are supporting. [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] is better against one boss.

Unfortunately, MEIKO's usefulness will fall substantially once [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is obtained, as it outperforms her in almost any scenario outside of a few [[Restriction Stage]]s.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper}}

